  "notes": ["The original Nurse request initializes type 21 and model record 77 on the next bucket visit. The original guard expires on that same actor visit, exposing both receiver lists.","Independent forks offer the exact Tau opcode with a declared caster and pose. Only the low-HP control changes the healed actor's HP inlet. No fork edits its owner bit or receive-mask fields.","The original collision walk reaches the HP writer and then either the nonlethal reaction or the zero-HP defeat helper. Both continue to the original presentation cut without drawing.","The defeat helper itself puts the receiver in phase 2 and clears +0x8C4. Its already-initialized effect is still active at the cut and goes through separate bucket visits before returning the exact heap payload and pool cells.","The lethal 15-HP request removes 7 HP; request ledgers and retained token history do not collapse to HP removed. The replacement and common archives are retained.","This is a bounded original defeat path, not a census of natural bit writers, live inputs, later actor removal, hardware or native gameplay."],
